{"name":"Finesse","hex":"#96a8c8","fetched":"2026-10-12","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"finesse","whole":true,"parts":[{"part":"Noun","definitions":["A skill in the handling or manipulation of a situation. .mw-parser-output .defdate{font-size:smaller}","The property of having elegance, grace, refinement, or skill."]},{"part":"Verb","definitions":["To evade (a problem, situation, etc.) by using some clever argument or stratagem.\n\n To handle or manage carefully or skilfully; to manipulate in a crafty way.","To handle or manage carefully or skilfully; to manipulate in a crafty way."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/finesse"}],"entries":[{"title":"Finesse","blocks":[{"text":"In contract bridge and similar games, a finesse is a type of card play technique which will enable a player to win an additional trick or tricks should there be a favorable position of one or more cards in the hands of the opponents."}],"link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Finesse"},{"title":"Finesse (Bruno Mars song)","blocks":[{"text":"\"Finesse\" is a song by American singer Bruno Mars from his third studio album, 24K Magic (2016). The song was written by Mars, Philip Lawrence, Christopher Brody Brown, James Fauntleroy, Jonathan Yip, Ray Romulus, Jeremy Reeves and Ray McCullough II. The former three produced it under the name Shampoo Press & Curl, along with the latter four, as the Stereotypes. The song was composed after a jam session as Mars wanted to recreate the \"new jack swing sound\". Atlantic Records released a remix, featuring verses from American rapper Cardi B, as the album's fifth and final single on January 4, 2018. Musically, it is a new jack swing, hip-hop soul and funk song. The lyrics demonstrate the happiness of being with who one loves and the positive outcome of that for them and others."}],"image":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/9/95/Bruno_Mars_%26_Cardi_B_-_Finesse.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Finesse_(Bruno_Mars_song)"}],"images":[],"sounds":{"finesse":[{"type":"audio/ogg; codecs=\"vorbis\"","src":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/a/ab/En-au-finesse.ogg?utm_source=en.wiktionary.org&utm_campaign=rest&utm_content=original"},{"type":"audio/mpeg","src":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/a/ab/En-au-finesse.ogg/En-au-finesse.ogg.mp3"}]},"pictures":[{"title":"Grey Bushchat in Sillery Gaon March 2025 by Tisha Mukherjee 01","image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/f/f9/Grey_Bushchat_in_Sillery_Gaon_March_2025_by_Tisha_Mukherjee_01.jpg/500px-Grey_Bushchat_in_Sillery_Gaon_March_2025_by_Tisha_Mukherjee_01.jpg","ratio":1.3997488488907492,"link":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Grey_Bushchat_in_Sillery_Gaon_March_2025_by_Tisha_Mukherjee_01.jpg","share":0.268125},{"title":"Grey heron 2022 04 03 03","image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/9/9a/Grey_heron_2022_04_03_03.jpg/500px-Grey_heron_2022_04_03_03.jpg","ratio":1.5,"link":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Grey_heron_2022_04_03_03.jpg","share":0.189375},{"title":"BASALT-FINESSE 2016 (48252534106)","image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/e/e4/BASALT-FINESSE_2016_%2848252534106%29.jpg/500px-BASALT-FINESSE_2016_%2848252534106%29.jpg","ratio":0.75,"link":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:BASALT-FINESSE_2016_(48252534106).jpg","share":0.12625},{"title":"Mk6 escort finesse 5 door","image":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/5/51/Mk6_escort_finesse_5_door.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","ratio":1.3333333333333333,"link":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Mk6_escort_finesse_5_door.jpg","share":0.11125},{"title":"Furnishings with Finesse (11389734696)","image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/4/4d/Furnishings_with_Finesse_%2811389734696%29.jpg/500px-Furnishings_with_Finesse_%28113897346